Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.17,0:02:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death aura ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The flame metal is a yang-attribute ore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.45,0:02:13.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,So why is the death aura
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.29,0:02:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,so dense on Planet Yun Xia ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Yun Xia is not in some remote place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can there not be a single human on this planet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:38.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:45.61,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(202,465)}Moongazer Serpent\NNirvana Scryer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:47.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Moongazer Serpent !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could this thing exist here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I saw in Tu Si's memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,that Moongazer Serpents are parasites living in Ancient God's bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,They survive by feeding on Ancient God Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:01.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Moongazer Serpents don't harm the Ancient God's massive body
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:04.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and can even be used by the Ancient God like artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once an Ancient God dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:09.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Moongazer Serpents die alongside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's almost impossible for them to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:15.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, Tu Si had been dead for so long
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:17.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,that there was no trace of Moongazer Serpents
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:18.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the Land of the Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:21.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be that Planet Yun Xia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:24.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,has the remains of another Ancient God ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:26.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that's really the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,how could the leaders of the Allheaven Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.21,0:03:30.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,be ignoring it like that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:32.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:35.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to quickly find that flame metal vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:39.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,000)\pos(141,523)}1 hour later
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:42.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,There really is a flame metal vein here !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:42.49,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(198,477)}Flame metal vein\NPlanet Yun Xia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:43.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:46.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This entire ore vein is ours !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:48.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,we've struck it rich !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:49.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just give me the order
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:53.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Little Xu will start digging it right away !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.29,0:04:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.77,0:04:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This flame metal vein
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.01,0:04:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't buried deep enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.17,0:04:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Any Ascendant cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:07.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,could find it easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:10.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a precious treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot possibly survive the countless millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:15.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moreover,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.45,0:04:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,if it were a naturally formed ore,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,it should not be so pure and regular.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:21.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,looks more like a bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.09,0:04:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,These aren't trees...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:33.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're tentacles !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The whole Planet Yun Xia
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the skeleton made of flame metal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:40.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,of a giant sleeping Moongazer Serpent !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I had tried to excavate the flame metal vein earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,it would have likely awakened the Moongazer Serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't have survived
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,against this giant beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:54.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Throughout history,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:55.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,those who coveted the flame metal vein
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:04:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,have likely all died here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:03.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this flame metal vein is crucial for the Heaven Defying Bead...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am determined to obtain it !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will need to find another way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:10.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,to extract it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.25,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(239,468)\fad(300,000)}Illusion Moon Pool\NPlanet Thousand Illusions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:30.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Mei,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.69,0:05:32.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,after the blood exchange ritual
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:37.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,will truly become a member of the Huan Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:40.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter what you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:43.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't betray the blood of the Huan Family !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand illusions as the soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.73,0:05:51.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand drops of blood as the guide,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:54.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I Huan Wuqing, a member of the 26th generation of the Huan Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,humbly requests
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:05:59.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,the ancestral bloodline !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,A long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:09.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Huan Family's ancestor was a Celestial of the Thunder Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although the Celestial Realm was destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:12.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,the bloodline still remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:15.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,This blood exchange ritual
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:17.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,refines the purest bloodline
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.85,0:06:20.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the blood of tens of thousands of disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:22.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,to create a blood imprint on a person's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, even the Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:29.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,has willingly lowered his own cultivation by one realm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,by personally infusing a large amount of his essence blood into this imprint
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,to cleanse her meridians.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:36.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is he paying such a price
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:38.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,just for her sake !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand illusions
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:44.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Identityless !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:03.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor's Ten Thousand Illusions Identityless Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:05.05,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(234,464)}Ten Thousand Illusions\NIdentityless Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the pinnacle of the Huan Family
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,but doesn't have a successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be that the Ancestor's gesture of imparting his teachings
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to nurture a successor who follows his Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.85,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(195,507)}Huan Mei\NPeak Late stage\NAscendant
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:26.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:27.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is that possible ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Her domain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is evolving !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:36.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The domains left behind by the family's Ancient Celestials
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,were the Heavenly Devil and Identityless Daos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The strongest was the Heavenly Devil Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,but was long lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yet the aura of this woman's domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.81,0:07:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,A domain evolution
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is unheard of !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:57.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ancestor's plan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:02.85,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(236,469)}Thousand Illusions\NHeavenly Devil Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mei'er
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,thanks the Ancestor for giving me a new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.01,0:08:11.17,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(251,524)}Huan Wuqing\NCorporeal Yang\N(originally Nirvana Scryer)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You truly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,didn't disappoint me !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestors of the Huan Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.37,0:08:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you see this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:22.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ten Thousand Illusions Heavenly Devil Dao that was long lost by the Huan Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:25.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,sees the light of day once more !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.93,0:08:27.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Mei,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.93,0:08:31.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is your first battle as a member of the Huan Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:34.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go to Planet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and carve out your fearsome reputation !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:42.57,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(242,481)}Planet Sealing Formation\NPlanet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.61,0:08:46.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even with the three of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,this Planet Sealing Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:51.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:01.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we don't break the formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:05.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,then are we waiting to die !?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This matter
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,is likely meant to establish Huan Mei's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu Mu said
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:12.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,he would return
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:14.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,in 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Huan Family isn't even here yet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:18.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this person has already fled !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:20.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why would he come back !?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,She's here !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:35.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are the Ancestors of the families of Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,you three ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:41.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is she really...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.57,0:09:42.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Mei ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:46.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will our Planet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:47.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,really be exterminated by a frail woman
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:49.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,all alone ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.25,0:09:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Sun, Brother Zhao,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:55.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,a great calamity is upon us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:58.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's fight without any restraint !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.89,0:10:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if we die,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.41,0:10:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,we won't have any regrets !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ran is so heroic !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you are burning your Origin Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.01,0:10:08.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,will accompany you !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.93,0:10:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:12.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,fall behind you guys !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's very thoughtful of you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.09,0:10:18.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you're all willingly fighting to the death,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,it saves me a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dao comprehension !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:40.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:42.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you're going to burn your Origin Souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.73,0:10:44.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,burn them more thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:48.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Zhao,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,wake up !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:54.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,help me !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.13,0:11:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:12.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dao comprehension is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could have also confused my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:42.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you purposely kept me awake
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:44.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be slaughtered by my allies !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a vicious tactic...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.21,0:11:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:51.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,ever raised a hand on you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:53.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You three just fought among yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have anything to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:59.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the Ten Thousand Illusions Heavenly Devil Dao,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never need allies to fight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wherever I go,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.69,0:12:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,countless cultivators will fight for me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,and die for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.73,0:12:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given your strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,you three can't be the ones who killed Huan Dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:25.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who else
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:26.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,was there ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.69,0:12:30.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You three sacrificed your bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and ignited your Origin Souls as a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:35.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you think I wouldn't see through it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:38.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You still have avatars to save yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:41.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please spare my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:42.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,that person is named is Xu Mu !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:43.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's the one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.85,0:12:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,who killed the member of your Huan Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.77,0:12:48.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,He left this place 2 days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:50.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to find his trail,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:52.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can help you !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,No rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:12:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,One by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once stained with the blood of the Huan Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.01,0:13:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I left a few days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,there wasn't such a restriction on Planet Ran Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation is quite complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:16.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Breaking it will take some time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,But entering the formation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:29.85,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(198,472)}Ice Plains\NPlanet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.09,0:13:31.57,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(254,474)}Sun Xi's avatar\NLate stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:34.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's her !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.57,0:13:36.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Peak Late stage Ascendant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.09,0:13:38.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am not confident
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:40.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,in fighting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:44.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I have changed my appearance using the Celestial Guard's spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,She shouldn't recognize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:48.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,This avatar was for saving my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have never told anyone its location.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.61,0:13:51.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did she
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:52.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,find it so easily !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:55.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You ignited your Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.17,0:13:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,yet succumbed to your own desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.01,0:14:00.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,You fought to the death
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,while keeping an avatar to save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:04.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much of your righteousness
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:07.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,is even genuine ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.77,0:14:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:28.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:28.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,save me !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.53,0:14:30.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you didn't tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you have an avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.69,0:14:39.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,I suppose you were planning to have me fight to the death with the Huan Family
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:40.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,and whether I succeeded or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:42.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,you could use this avatar to save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:47.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although you lack honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.85,0:14:49.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have taken your celestial jades
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I will protect you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.01,0:14:57.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I advise you not to meddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.53,0:14:59.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,leave Planet Ran Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.09,0:15:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,that your cultivation had also reached Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:22.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you really think that by hiding your appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and changing your aura,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:27.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't recognize you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:33.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,But at Early stage Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:36.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are destined to die here !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then on Planet Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:43.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,when you destroyed my domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:45.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I used the Thousand Illusions Ruthless Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.89,0:15:47.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,to glimpse at your obsessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:49.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,by destroying your Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and shattering your obsessions,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will fulfill my hatred !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.73,0:16:04.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will send you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reunite with Li Muwan !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.85,0:16:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're seeking death !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.93,0:16:52.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of spell is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I look with my Divine Sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:57.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,this person looks exactly like the real Red Butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it's just an illusion !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop playing tricks !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.33,0:17:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:10.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:12.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill Little Ru'er ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,An illusion...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:15.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is also an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.69,0:17:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,remember to pass down the Billion Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:24.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and make the Soul Refining Sect of Planet Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,flourish again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.13,0:17:27.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:30.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Illusions...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.77,0:17:34.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Son...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:46.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:49.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:00.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ten Thousand Illusions Heavenly Devil Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,can borrow the opponent's memories
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,to ignite their Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and burn their body and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,All it takes is a moment of weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be at my mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.65,0:18:13.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,your Origin Soul has been ignited.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,The outcome
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.61,0:18:19.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is already decided !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder !?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could there be thunder energy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:33.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,in his Origin Soul !?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is this possible !?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:39.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,When karma has been resolved,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:40.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,the heart doesn't have regrets
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,and can be at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.49,0:18:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if karma hasn't been resolved,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:48.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,then even in the face of the will of the heavens,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,, it must be defied.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:52.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Dao I understood
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.05,0:18:54.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,when I reached Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,My obsessions
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot be controlled by your mere domain !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.61,0:19:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although your cultivation was forcibly raised,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.57,0:19:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,our domains
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.49,0:19:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,are worlds apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.09,0:19:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your domain
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:20.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot break this Dao Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.65,0:19:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your illusions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot ignite
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Origin Soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:20:04.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Ask
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:02.10,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1514,677)}Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:04.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the perilous path filled with countless blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:05.38,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1299,685)}Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.90,0:20:11.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Can the mundane world be shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:08.70,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,705)\fad(800,000)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:12.14,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:11.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:17.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:15.58,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:18.78,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:17.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:24.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:25.06,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:24.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:29.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:29.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:37.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:37.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:42.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:42.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:50.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.14,0:20:50.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.30,0:20:54.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:54.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.86,0:20:58.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:58.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:04.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:04.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:08.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.98,0:21:08.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:11.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:11.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:17.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:17.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:23.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:23.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:41.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:41.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:45.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:51.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.10,0:21:51.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:54.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:54.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:58.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:58.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:22:04.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:04.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:10.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:10.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
